        APB2_Bridge["AHB-to-APB2 Bridge (0x40010000: SYSCFG, VREFBUF, COMP1-7, OPAMP1-6, EXTI, TIM1/8/15-17/20, SPI1, USART1, SAI1, HRTIM1)"]
